# तेज़ चला मेले में
#
# The artwork, the audio and the film are the project — they are committed, not
# ignored. There is no build step and nothing is generated, so the only things
# that have no business in the repository are what the operating system and the
# editors leave lying about.
#
# .vscode/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the three settings.json files in it pin
# the Live Server ports the story and the game are served on, which is project
# configuration rather than personal preference.

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
._*

# editors
*.swp
*~
.idea/

# logs and local scratch
*.log
npm-debug.log*
